# Every text file is LF, in git AND on disk (issue I24, docs/patterns/issues.md).
# Git for Windows sets core.autocrlf=true system-wide: without this, files
# written with LF (Claude's Write/Edit) warn "LF will be replaced by CRLF"
# on every commit, the checkout turns them CRLF, and a CRLF shell hook
# breaks ("\r: command not found").
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.mp4 binary
*.wav binary
